 <tr class="bg-slate-50"><td class="p-3 font-bold">Temps conducteur perdu</td><td class="p-3 text-center">Charge lente = 30 min/j x 250j = 125h</td><td class="p-3 text-center">Charge rapide = 10 min/j x 250j = 42h</td><td class="p-3 text-center text-green-600 font-bold">83h economisees</td></tr>
